      "estimatedOutput": 672,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/guwen-337--f025c580414fc28ef0ba03dbd2ceb1065ba8e340ad5fce1296d0ff6c28b4769c.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "guwen-338",
      "category": "古文",
      "title": "围炉夜话·第一一三则",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "王永彬",
      "dynasty": "清",
      "content": "道本足于身，切实求来，则常若不足矣；境难足于心，尽行放下，则未有不足矣。",
      "excerptOf": "围炉夜话",
      "excerptNote": "完整选录《围炉夜话》中“第一一三则”一则或一章；非全书。",
      "inputHash": "22b8878e09f640553dbfcbc048c213ee0e654285a2c25b2a29f70b686546584f",
      "estimatedOutput": 708,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/guwen-338--22b8878e09f640553dbfcbc048c213ee0e654285a2c25b2a29f70b686546584f.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "guwen-339",
      "category": "古文",
      "title": "围炉夜话·第一一四则",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "王永彬",
      "dynasty": "清",
      "content": "读书不下苦功，妄想显荣，岂有此理？为人全无好处，欲邀福庆，从何得来？",
      "excerptOf": "围炉夜话",
      "excerptNote": "完整选录《围炉夜话》中“第一一四则”一则或一章；非全书。",
      "inputHash": "6b9560a7a95231d31ecf0520415cde4a2304de682bafc3fcb08ad0785e6a368e",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/guwen-339--6b9560a7a95231d31ecf0520415cde4a2304de682bafc3fcb08ad0785e6a368e.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "guwen-340",
      "category": "古文",
      "title": "围炉夜话·第一一五则",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "王永彬",
      "dynasty": "清",
      "content": "才觉己有不是，便决意改图，此立志为君子也；明知人议其非，偏肆行无忌，此甘心为小人也。",
      "excerptOf": "围炉夜话",
      "excerptNote": "完整选录《围炉夜话》中“第一一五则”一则或一章；非全书。",
