      "estimatedOutput": 726,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/guwen-340--5c162f0c1c1d3ce4c21e618b1b5e7a6736f4834d314229c0121a41291af67773.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "guwen-341",
      "category": "古文",
      "title": "围炉夜话·第一一七则",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "王永彬",
      "dynasty": "清",
      "content": "凡遇事物突来，必熟思审处，恐贻后悔；不幸家庭衅起，须忍让曲全，勿失旧欢。",
      "excerptOf": "围炉夜话",
      "excerptNote": "完整选录《围炉夜话》中“第一一七则”一则或一章；非全书。",
      "inputHash": "dd24d4a827d51838062ba44d0af240cdfeb9289b00be4c3a95b14808fa4c9b13",
      "estimatedOutput": 708,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/guwen-341--dd24d4a827d51838062ba44d0af240cdfeb9289b00be4c3a95b14808fa4c9b13.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "guwen-342",
      "category": "古文",
      "title": "围炉夜话·第一一八则",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "王永彬",
      "dynasty": "清",
      "content": "聪明勿使外散，古人有纩以塞耳，旒以蔽目者矣；耕读何妨兼营，古人有出而负耒，入而横经者矣。",
      "excerptOf": "围炉夜话",
      "excerptNote": "完整选录《围炉夜话》中“第一一八则”一则或一章；非全书。",
      "inputHash": "1e2df2d68648e43f61588d97fa8f51ae17c423699a67d016560ababae1ca8e29",
      "estimatedOutput": 732,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/guwen-342--1e2df2d68648e43f61588d97fa8f51ae17c423699a67d016560ababae1ca8e29.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "guwen-343",
      "category": "古文",
      "title": "围炉夜话·第一一九则",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "王永彬",
      "dynasty": "清",
      "content": "身不饥寒，天未尝负我；学无长进，我何以对天。",
      "excerptOf": "围炉夜话",
      "excerptNote": "完整选录《围炉夜话》中“第一一九则”一则或一章；非全书。",
      "inputHash": "85fc41514c5900fbff86db437a91a1c3f33f1ea9ebb4b8de3335545b71a2e6eb",
      "estimatedOutput": 666,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/guwen-343--85fc41514c5900fbff86db437a91a1c3f33f1ea9ebb4b8de3335545b71a2e6eb.json"
    },
    {
